# 🎬 Movie Recommendation System

A simple Python-based movie recommendation system that recommends movies based on the user's selected genre and mood.

## Features

- 🎬 Get movie recommendations
- 🔍 Search for movies
- 📋 View all movies
- ⭐ View top-rated movies
- 🎭 Filter movies by genre and mood

## Concepts Used

- Lists
- Dictionaries
- Functions
- Loops
- If/else statements
- String methods
- Sorting

## Future Improvements

- Favorite movies
- User ratings
- Watch history
- Better recommendation system
- AI-based recommendations

**Built with Python**
